      "message": "Nit: This change further nests this code, so the lines are even more broken up than they were. As noted above, the actual function calls are very similar between the old code and the new branch.\n\nIf you truly don\u0027t need `typec_set_input_current_limit`, it seems like you could reduce nesting here by defining variables for the arguments to these functions and then setting them based on `supply_voltage` and `curr_limit`.",
